---
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<section id="contato" class="contact section-space" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
  <div class="container contact-grid">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow"><span class="small-line" aria-hidden="true"></span> VAMOS CONVERSAR</p>
      <h2 id="contact-title">Toda jornada começa<br />com uma <em>conversa.</em></h2>
      <p class="contact-intro">Se este é o seu momento, entre em contato.<br />Há espaço para as suas perguntas.</p>
      <a class="button button-gold" href={site.whatsapp} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Conversar pelo WhatsApp <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span><span class="sr-only"> (abre em nova aba)</span></a>
    </div>
    <div class="contact-details">
      <a class="contact-row" href={site.phoneHref}><span class="contact-label">TELEFONE / WHATSAPP</span><span>{site.phone}<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></a>
      <a class="contact-row" href={`mailto:${site.email}`}><span class="contact-label">E-MAIL</span><span>{site.email}<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></a>
      <a class="contact-row" href={site.instagram} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="contact-label">INSTAGRAM</span><span>{site.instagramHandle}<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span><span class="sr-only"> (abre em nova aba)</span></a>
      <div class="contact-location"><span class="contact-label">LOCALIZAÇÃO</span><p>{site.location}<br />{site.city}</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
